      {
        "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.CfgCurtainCaption, Assembly-CSharp",
        "textGroupId": "203104501_4",
        "content": "绵朵莉正在制作玩偶……\n好像有什么东西，从玩偶的肚子里，掉了出来。",
        "content_l10n": {
          "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
          "textId": "Performance_203104501_3148337313_content",
          "value": "绵朵莉正在制作玩偶……\n好像有什么东西，从玩偶的肚子里，掉了出来。",
